{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09226","headline":"答僴奴重阳二甥 · 韦应物","name":"答僴奴重阳二甥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弃职曾守拙，翫幽遂忘喧。\n山涧依硗𥕂，竹树荫清源\n贫居烟火湿，岁熟梨枣繁。\n风雨飘茅屋，蒿草没瓜园。\n羣属相欢悦，不觉过朝昏。\n有时看禾黍，落日上秋原。\n饮酒任真性，挥笔肆狂言。\n一朝忝兰省，三载居远藩。\n复与诸弟子，篇翰每相敦。\n西园休习射，南池对芳樽。\n山药经雨碧，海榴凌霜飜。\n念尔不同此，怅然复一论。\n重阳守故家，僴子旅湘沅。\n俱有缄中藻，恻恻动离魂。\n不知何日见，衣上泪空存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}